Julie, Michael who the hell were those two people and how can we make them dead?

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:15.280
They actually you know, it was a scene that we shot for the season finale

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:20.600
Uh, at the end of last year, we wanted to kind of have a little tag at the end that said,

00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:22.940
"Oh there's danger coming in a new form"

00:02:22.940 --> 00:02:28.120
