00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:30.760
Sort of stewing up that there were new enemies to come , and then we hadn't started shooting this year yet

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:34.920
Uh, you love to come to comic con and show off new footage but we didn't have any

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:39.280
And we thought, hmm how can we show the audience like what is in the works?

00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:42.240
And we thought, "Oh! There's that scene!"

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:49.240
And it's just a hint of--Narducci it's just a hint of uh what's to come in terms of the new villians maybe.

00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:56.200
Well yeah, we've talked a lot about how the Mikaelsons have been around for 1000 years and

